  "description": "One line at each side of the red line. The first skater crosses the ice and takes a pass from the other line. They stay wide around the cone, cross over at the blue line and drive to the far post. The passer cuts inside and drives to the slot. The puck carrier passes back to them for a quick shot, then both look for the rebound. Go from both sides.",
